---
description: Never attribute git commits or PRs to Cursor/cursoragent
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git author identity

- Commits and PRs must use only the repository's configured `user.name` / `user.email`.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, or any `cursoragent@…` trailer.
- Never set `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*` to Cursor or cursoragent.
- Do not amend history solely to rebrand authorship unless the user explicitly requests a rewrite.
